sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements BinaryPipeSendResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements BinaryPipeSend]

    Note over Product, CN: Precondition: BinaryPipeConnection.Available received

    Product->>CN: BinaryPipeSend.SendData(<br>subchannel=1, data=256 bytes)
    Note right of Product: Must wait for SendCompleted before next send
    CN-->>Product: BinaryPipeSendResponse.SendCompleted()

    Product->>CN: BinaryPipeSend.SendData(<br>subchannel=1, data=256 bytes)
    CN-->>Product: BinaryPipeSendResponse.SendCompleted()

    Product->>CN: BinaryPipeSend.SendData(<br>subchannel=1, data=256 bytes)
    CN-->>Product: BinaryPipeSendResponse.SendCompleted()
